{"src":"en","tgt":"ru","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ru","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6139.934922,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6874.35261,"text":"Но после потери капитана Индия смогла набрать всего 36 очков; потеря семи игроков стала серьезной проблемой."},{"kind":"audio","t":7011.147682999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7012.776146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7014.020950999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7014.7860359999995,"samples":11758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"audio","t":7016.240474999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7017.938989999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7018.294177,"samples":13876,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":12751.847321,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13684.648132,"text":"Обычно у них есть специальные предложения по еде, напиткам и развлечениям, чтобы поддерживать гостей в хорошем настроении и удерживать их на территории."},{"kind":"audio","t":13914.513036999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13915.803433,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13917.421765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13919.059379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13920.693021,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13922.308324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13923.941947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":13924.142141,"samples":4959,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19235.882947000002,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19927.30991,"text":"У Дель Потро есть преимущество в начале второго сета, но после этого слишком необходимо играть тай-брейк."},{"kind":"audio","t":20106.174009000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20107.615168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":20109.126458000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":20110.839083000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20112.504787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":20113.890354000003,"samples":21733,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":25300.862530000002,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25790.865100000003,"text":"Интернет сочетает в себе элементы как массовой, так и межличностной коммуникации."},{"kind":"audio","t":25918.025908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25919.779484000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25921.286044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25923.038929000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25923.206493,"samples":8247,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":34440.427821000005,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":35292.038418000004,"text":"Состав этих кристаллов совпадает с тем, что обнаруживается в моче больных животных при сравнении с помощью инфракрасной спектроскопии."},{"kind":"audio","t":35500.175446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35501.544974000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35503.227428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35504.888511000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35506.431122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":35508.103566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35508.661737,"samples":14879,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":36883.673766,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":36984.28749,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"audio","t":37017.348096,"samples":23405,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":830},{"kind":"input","t":42286.23712,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":43064.726515,"text":"На некоторых маршрутах крупные компании имеют собственные самолеты, но на других маршрутах у меньших фирм их не было."},{"kind":"audio","t":43227.759855000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43229.314627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43230.98016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":43232.631483000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":570,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43234.335328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43235.124564,"samples":18947,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":49504.836237,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":50008.35009,"text":"У некоторых атомов нестабильные ядра, что означает, что они склонны распадаться."},{"kind":"audio","t":50127.345104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50128.696791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50130.262953000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50131.942817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50132.064349,"samples":2953,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":53494.095592,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53821.359547,"text":"и разрушаются при незначительном воздействии или без него."},{"kind":"audio","t":53904.347257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53905.675224,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":53906.797167000004,"samples":24743,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":60640.066998,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61744.970921,"text":"В том же месяце ещё один пассажирский самолёт съехал с взлётно-посадочной полосы в Мошленде и врезался в стену, в результате чего погибли 17 человек."},{"kind":"audio","t":61969.792255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61971.150892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61972.797726000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61974.418788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61976.025160000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":61977.617633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61979.209915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61980.874148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":61982.244466000004,"samples":28755,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1090},{"kind":"input","t":67208.90436,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67858.026932,"text":"Почти все это песчаные пляжи, где можно безопасно купаться, и на большинстве из них есть укрытие от солнца."},{"kind":"audio","t":68007.47836899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":68008.727684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68010.38062699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":68011.955649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":480,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68013.694374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68013.902588,"samples":10030,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":70268.80129199999,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70450.10247099999,"text":"Деревья похикан."},{"kind":"audio","t":70495.458143,"samples":32322,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1190},{"kind":"input","t":76426.252067,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby,"},{"kind":"text","t":77153.205865,"text":"Популярными видами спорта являются футбол, баскетбол, волейбол, водное поло, фехтование, регби."},{"kind":"audio","t":77311.61798299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":77312.97402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":77314.53423199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":77316.269066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":77318.013071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77319.75517599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77320.04786199999,"samples":8470,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":80699.900264,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":81190.266381,"text":"велоспорт, хоккей с шайбой, роллерный хоккей и Формула-1."},{"kind":"audio","t":81284.93485599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81286.346955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81287.960427,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81288.554959,"samples":15659,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":86518.443728,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86941.082553,"text":"В теплом климате Ближнего Востока дом не имел такого большого значения."},{"kind":"audio","t":87030.456731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87032.26827799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87033.742617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87033.87186999999,"samples":2842,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":93191.935827,"text":"The lake lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula."},{"kind":"text","t":93654.692188,"text":"Озеро расположено в 120 километрах к северу от полуострова."},{"kind":"audio","t":93739.61978699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93741.16632799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93742.64877799999,"samples":30873,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":98322.87129499999,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":99037.48589499999,"text":"Цвет сока капусты меняется в зависимости от того, насколько кислой, щелочной или основной является его химическая среда."},{"kind":"audio","t":99206.900484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99208.24088099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99209.827993,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99211.418735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":99213.087378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99214.70241099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99216.17635099999,"samples":30204,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":105745.671202,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106847.72614799999,"text":"Ожидается, что мост войдёт в полную эксплуатацию в сентябре 2017 года, когда, как предполагается, будут завершены работы по строительству бразильских таможенных пунктов контроля."},{"kind":"audio","t":107082.687866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107084.513863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107085.80316899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107087.390611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107088.918792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":107090.53009399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":107092.138156,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107093.75523899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":107095.53282499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107095.91774199999,"samples":13541,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":113144.09883799999,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":114115.48658499999,"text":"Влага на ваших руках будет вступать в реакцию с внешними слоями, из-за чего они будут иметь необычное ощущение и образуют своего рода покров."},{"kind":"audio","t":114331.192445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114332.63506399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114334.26318699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114335.879449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114337.521343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114339.13809499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":114340.76234799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114341.54705299999,"samples":18334,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":119589.587978,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":120065.894502,"text":"Одна бомба взорвалась возле офиса генерал-губернатора."},{"kind":"audio","t":120144.40635199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120146.069546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120146.88747199999,"samples":25300,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":125297.596278,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125774.257,"text":"Марокканский султан перестроил город под названием Дару и Байт."},{"kind":"audio","t":125866.05742699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":125867.45412499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125869.039227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125869.417964,"samples":10922,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":130424.152378,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130990.64980699998,"text":"Испанские торговцы, основавшие торговые посты, дали ему название Касабланка."},{"kind":"audio","t":131107.85504599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131109.334286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131110.949238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":131112.52889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131113.467519,"samples":20786,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":142819.510275,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":144041.512585,"text":"Его приветствовал заместитель премьер-министра Сингапура Вонг Кан-сенг, а также он обсудил вопросы торговли и терроризма с премьер-министром Сингапура Ли Сяньлуном."},{"kind":"audio","t":144244.599172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144245.953629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144247.538691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144249.081432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144250.667444,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144252.28941599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144253.91425899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144255.578383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144255.678735,"samples":3677,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":154251.963387,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":155188.171176,"text":"Бомба на основе ядерного деления работает по принципу, согласно которому для сформирования ядра с большим количеством протонов и нейтронов требуется энергия."},{"kind":"audio","t":155393.708542,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155395.192792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155397.214953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":155398.700182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155400.318025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155401.910057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155403.55888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155405.220424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155406.02069,"samples":18445,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":162808.484357,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":163211.47418699999,"text":"На архипелагах и озерах вам не обязательно нужен яхта."},{"kind":"audio","t":163298.344805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":163299.863215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163301.331995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163301.450457,"samples":4513,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":174605.635146,"code":1005}]}